error[E0277]: `Result<Patches<Counter>, DatabaseError>` is not a reply of an action on the page whose signals are `Counter`
  --> tests/ui/fail/handler_error_not_a_response.rs:20:35
   |
20 |     let _: Router = Router::new().action(ADD, add);
   |                                   ^^^^^^ the trait `IntoActionResponse<Counter>` is not implemented for `Result<Patches<Counter>, DatabaseError>`
