   = note: an action's handler returns `Patches<Counter>`, a `SignalPatch<Counter>`, a `ListPatch<Counter>`, a tuple of response parts and one of those, or a `Result` of one of those whose error implements `IntoResponse`
note: required by a bound in `action`
